WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.770
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.980
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world</i>

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:07.480
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique!</i>

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.900
<i>Louise, the leader of the Valkyries,</i>

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.700
<i>a unit of beautiful women, 
suddenly attacked me, but then...</i>

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.450
May I call you Master?

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.330
Wh-What?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.140
<i>She suddenly became my apprentice?!</i>

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.830
<i>But I had no time to be surprised before...</i>

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.580
Someone has attacked the king!

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.950
<i>The assassin... is a child?!</i>

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.660
<i>What on earth is going on in 
my life in another world?!</i>

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.450
<i>This kid has abnormal speed.</i>

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Name: Oliga Calmeria...</i>

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.530
<i>Age: 8?</i>

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.740
<i>And she's a girl, too!</i>

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:53.530
<i>Conditions: Enslaved?</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.490
<i>Does that mean she's someone's slave?</i>

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.740
<i>She's coming this way!</i>

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:04.560
Wow.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:08.130
You really do look just like an assassin.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.530
H-How?!

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:11.630
Huh? What do you mean, "how"?

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:13.780
You must die!

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:18.160
Not bad.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.390
You threw a second knife 
just after the first, huh?

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:25.790
These are dangerous for a child 
to have, so I'm confiscating them.

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:28.410
<i>Skill: Reflexive Defense activated.</i>

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.400
Huh?

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:32.900
Look out! Dodge it!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.540
Sorry!

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.350
<i>Th-That was close!</i>

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:40.370
<i>The Reflexive Defense skill, huh?</i>

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.660
<i>My body reacted on its own!</i>

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.160
This won't...

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.530
<i>She's more childish than I thought.</i>

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:59.050
<i>Why would this girl become an assassin?</i>

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.220
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.220
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:34.120
<b>Black Cat Oliga</b>

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.820
Hey, there's something I'd like to ask you.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.360
Damn it!

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.610
Sorry.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.360
He disappeared?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:49.320
Why would such a small child attack the king?

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.470
Master!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.610
Seiichi-kun, who's that girl?

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:57.640
Everyone, this girl is the assassin.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.500
You're kidding, right?

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.220
How could this girl be the assassin?

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.860
It's hard for me to believe, as well.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.790
Lorna.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.980
Interrogate her, please.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.480
Right! Leave it to me!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.230
Interrogate her? Lorna-san will?

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.310
Despite appearances, Lorna is 
our nation's top interrogator.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.690
Leave it to me!

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.740
It's been a while, so I'm raring to go!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.740
B-By "interrogate," do you mean...

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:33.800
Lorna is the only person who's 
mastered Queen Eris's S&M Lectures.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:39.020
Come on, come on, come on, come on, 
you stupid barrel of meat!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.880
My muscles are telling me to enjoy this!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.330
Don't give me that composed attitude!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.370
Lorna!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:47.390
Right!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.890
Take that, and that, and that!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.480
It's working! My sphincter!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.150
Sounds like fun!

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:59.530
Setting that aside, 
you're still here, Seiichi-kun?

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.760
I was worried about the king.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.530
Is he all right?

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:07.180
His Majesty... won't wake up.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.330
The weapon this girl cut the 
king with was a Curse Knife.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:18.360
The curse that the knife was 
imbued with is "Eternal Slumber."

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.560
Once someone is wounded with that,

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:23.200
they'll never wake again.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.790
Eternal Slumber...

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:29.670
No one has ever found a way to undo the curse.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.800
What do we do?

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.930
If His Majesty never wakes again...

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.460
Louise-sama...

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.190
<i>I want to help them somehow.</i>

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.050
<i>A way to undo a curse...</i>

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:44.520
<i>With Ar's curse, I didn't undo it. 
I just inverted the effect.</i>

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.190
That's it!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.510
Everyone!

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:48.700
Please...

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.760
take me to the king!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.080
What?!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.580
No way! The king was...

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.580
Ranze-san?!

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.440
Wh-What is this?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.840
Seiichi-kun?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.220
You knew His Majesty, Master?

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:15.010
Y-Yeah, we've met...

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:19.650
<i>I can't believe he's the king!</i>

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.760
<i>I-I didn't speak too impolitely, did I?</i>

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:23.800
You're the one?

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:24.780
Huh?

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:29.250
The one who might be 
able to wake His Majesty?

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.380
Master, I'll introduce you.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.750
This is my older brother, Florio Balze.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:37.290
He's the leader of our 
nation's magic division.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.220
Uh, I'm Seiichi.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.540
So how is the king doing?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:46.520
While I've healed his wounds with healing 
magic, I'm unable to stop the curse.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.440
I'm sorry.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:53.550
If even your healing magic 
can't undo the curse...

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:58.520
Seiichi-kun, I'm sorry, but could 
you please lend us your power?

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.940
Please.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:01.960
Please raise your heads.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:04.060
I'll see what I can do.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.070
You have my thanks, Seiichi-kun.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.900
<i>If there's no magic to undo curses,</i>

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.580
<i>then just create it.</i>

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.730
<i>A spell to deal with curses...</i>

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.950
<i>A spell to deal with curses...</i>

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.950
<i>Skill: Magic Creation activated.</i>

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.150
<i>First, I need a clear visualization.</i>

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.330
<i>A clear visual...</i>

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.580
<i>Visual...</i>

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.440
<i>What is a clear visual, anyway?!</i>

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:36.210
<i>What's a curse in the first place?</i>

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.610
<i>All these wrong things 
are coming to mind now!</i>

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.730
<i>Anyway, this isn't good.</i>

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.690
<i>I need a visualization 
of him getting better...</i>

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.240
<i>Get better...</i>

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.750
<i>Get better...</i>

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.250
<i>Get better...</i>

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:05.730
<b>Get Better, Get Better, Get Better</b>

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:06.060
<i>Get better, get better, 
get better, get better,</i>

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:08.250
<b>Get Better, Get Better, Get Better</b>

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:09.770
<i>get better, get better, get better, 
get better, get better!</i>

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.760
<b>Get Better</b>

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.120
Get Better.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:23.440
It just slipped from my mouth!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:23.440
<i>Invert Magic: Get Better has been created.</i>

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:24.490
Huh?

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.610
<i>Huh? What is Invert Magic: Get Better?</i>

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.700
<i>Does that mean it worked?!</i>

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.700
Th-This is...

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:41.770
<i>Curse: Eternal Slumber has been 
inverted into Charm: Eternal Health.</i>

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.250
S-Seriously?!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.710
Why was I asleep?

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.470
Huh? Seiichi?

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:57.840
Ranze-san!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.980
You did it!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:00.750
Your Majesty!

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.220
I'm so glad!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:07.900
Seiichi-kun here—no, Master Seiichi 
easily undid the curse on you!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:11.110
No, no, no, it wasn't that big a deal!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.520
I see!

00:09:12.520 --> 00:09:14.580
Thanks for saving me.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.360
I'll have to give you some kind of reward.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.420
You don't need to reward me.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:20.460
Master!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:27.100
Saving the king's life means you have saved 
every one of us living in this nation!

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.790
There's no need for modesty.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.530
That's right.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:35.420
Seiichi, I'll do anything I can for you as king.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.520
In that case, there is one thing...

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:45.310
Your Majesty!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.810
I humbly beseech you.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.940
What is it, Zakia?

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.210
There is something I must 
inquire about, Your Majesty.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.240
That's haughty of you, Zakia!

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.990
Your Majesty, where are 
the heroes right now?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.120
Hmph, those slaves?

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:11.000
I've sent them all to Barbador Magic Academy.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.500
For our benefit.

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:20.890
Hey, so you know...

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.140
Kannazuki-senpai!

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.880
At this rate, we heroes are likely 
to be ostracized at this academy.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.900
How did it end up like this?

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.680
I know the reason.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.350
Well, well.

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:37.360
What are you all doing over there?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.940
Tougou Rento,

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:46.410
Ooyama Tsuyoshi,

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:49.370
and Kisaragi Masaya.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.190
Don't glare at us like that, Kannazuki-san.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:56.460
Your good looks will go to waste.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.760
So? What were you all talking about?

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.290
It has nothing to do with you all.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.260
Get lost.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.950
Scary!

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:11.270
But you know, making such a strong-willed 
woman submit is also pretty great!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.310
Huh? What is it, Kenji?

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:22.280
You think you can go around acting 
superior to your club senior? Huh?!

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:27.540
Come on, now. If you don't hurry up 
and tell us what you were talking about,

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.160
we'll cause more problems.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.440
Scumbag!

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.360
Fine, I'll tell you, then!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:38.170
We were talking about the reason we heroes 
are becoming ostracized at this academy.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.500
What, that's all?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.180
The reason is obviously us.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:48.990
That old guy, Helio-san, told us to, remember?

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:53.060
Go show them the power of the heroes.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.210
Right?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:12:00.570
We're able to master the magic 
taught at this academy right away.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:04.860
Our potential's way different 
than those plebs.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.820
Exactly.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:09.790
Being a hero means being one of the strong.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.920
We're just exercising our privileges in 
a world where it's survival of the fittest.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.190
That's no reason to go so far!

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:23.340
Well, you have fun trying 
to act like good people.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.500
What was that?!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.150
Enough. Kenji, Shouta, let's go.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.410
But...

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.340
Just drop it.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:42.990
I can't believe there's such 
a large bath in the castle.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:45.950
Seiichi.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:48.160
This place is my dream.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:48.890
Huh?

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.620
Mind listening for a bit?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.380
By the way, Lorna,

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.380
is the interrogation of 
the assassin going well?

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:05.070
Well, actually, she's keeping 
her lips tightly sealed.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.600
Anyway, Louise-sama,

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:11.150
Your delicate skin is almost like silk!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.140
Th-That tickles!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:16.060
By the way, that was 
impressive earlier, wasn't it?

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:19.020
The reward Seiichi asked His Majesty for.

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:21.290
In that case, there is one thing...

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.020
That was so cool!

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:27.810
"King, I don't need any such grand reward.

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.050
I only desire one thing.

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:33.960
Please allow me to train in magic and 
swordsmanship with Louise and the others."

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.440
Me, too! Me, too!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.340
That's my Master for you.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.420
That's my Seiichi!

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:45.090
You're every bit the man I knew you were!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:48.910
Feel free to use the training areas 
and anything else as you like!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:52.600
They didn't say it quite like that, though.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.340
Hey, Saria.

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:59.520
Aren't you worried about Seiichi?

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.310
Huh?

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:04.360
I mean, he got dragged off by 
all those beautiful Valkyries.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.530
That's right. They took Master.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.160
Worried?

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.840
What I'm saying is,

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:15.790
he might come back with new women again!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:18.510
Are you okay with that, Saria-san?

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:21.400
I'm fine! After all, it's Seiichi.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.170
"After all, it's Seiichi"?

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:29.220
I have faith that Seiichi can overcome 
anything in an amusing way.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.090
I couldn't tell you why if you asked, though.

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:33.740
Saria-san...

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:38.350
I can't help but be jealous.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.430
Jealous?

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.700
Seiichi-kun, am I not good enough?

00:14:56.620 --> 00:15:01.400
Seiichi-kun, I want the genes 
of a strong man like you.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:11.730
We can only recognize love 
when it comes with pain.

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:16.140
If anything like that happens, 
I won't be able to curb my jealousy!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.420
Damn it! The jealousy!

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.650
Ow! My foot! I-It's cramping!

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:23.220
Ow, ow, ow! M-My foot!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.290
Hey, Seiichi.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:27.340
One day, I want

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:31.910
to build public baths throughout 
this nation—no, the entire world.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.950
Throughout the world?

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.050
Yeah.

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:38.040
When you're in the bath, 
nationality and race don't matter.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.630
Whether you're human or demon 
doesn't matter, either.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:44.040
Everyone's equal.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:47.880
One day, I want everyone in 
the world to stop fighting

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.220
and be able to enjoy spending time 
naked with each other like this.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:56.870
Well, that's my silly dream.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.270
Ranze-san...

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:01.890
Your Majesty!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:06.820
Is it true you sent the heroes 
to Barbador Magic Academy?!

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:09.320
Hmph. So what if it is?

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.990
How could you?!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:12.570
They were still—

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.860
Silence, insolent fool!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:19.450
You dare question His Majesty's ideas?

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.810
Hmph! They're all just 
sacrificial pawns, anyway.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.670
The heroes are sacrificial pawns?

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.010
What do you plan to do if they 
ever use their power against us?!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.690
The heroes revolting?

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.090
Impossible!

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.610
What?

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:37.930
I, the greatest mage in this empire,

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:42.230
Helio Robahn, have placed 
Enslavement Bracelets on them.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:44.390
Enslavement Bracelets?!

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:48.110
In the event they do try to remove them...

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.980
Helio, you bastard!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.090
Wh-Wh-Who's there?!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.970
Someone was sniping.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:04.250
Likely an enemy targeting Your Majesty.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.930
Hey, Zakia!

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:07.760
What are you dawdling for?!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:10.880
Go and capture the foe 
who shot at me right away!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.120
At once.

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.380
Helio, I leave His Majesty to you.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.300
Hmph!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.890
Quit prattling and hurry!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.150
I can't believe someone would 
come after Your Majesty!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:30.400
Who on earth was behind this?

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.870
It wasn't those demons, was it?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.650
Your Majesty,

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.410
I recently heard something odd 
concerning the demons.

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.670
What is it?

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.740
I've heard that King Ranze of 
the nearby Kingdom of Wimberg

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:46.660
is forming an alliance with the demons.

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:48.770
Oh?

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:53.790
That would be treason when 
Your Majesty is obviously

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.920
preparing to fight them, would it not?

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.530
But there's no need for concern.

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.680
I've already taken measures.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.430
What?!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:07.120
I'm sure you've heard the name, as well.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:11.440
I sent out the Dark Executioner, 
the one nobody can escape once targeted,

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:14.940
the Twilight Assassin.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:20.360
Right around now, he should be tasting 
the same humiliation I just faced.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.120
Impressive, Your Majesty!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:25.900
Seiichi.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:26.680
Master.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:27.870
Seiichi-kun.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.690
Y-Yes?

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.460
Huh? Why are all of you here?

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:38.450
These ladies said they wished 
to see you, Seiichi-kun.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:42.780
Man, Saria's been so worried 
about you all this time!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.350
Huh? Wh-What?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.840
Saria...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.050
H-Hey, Ar!

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:52.600
Apparently, she couldn't stop her 
jealousy at the thought of you

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.290
surrounded by all the Valkyries.

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.620
Th-That's what <i>you</i> said, Ar!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:59.490
I-I never said any such thing.

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:02.740
Master!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.300
My, what a pretty woman.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.460
Such a sweet, floral scent!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:11.880
Seiichi!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.750
Have you and this woman already...

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.220
I-It's not what you think!

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.260
She's Louise, the captain of the Valkyries.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.760
Wha... You're <i>the</i> Knight of Swords?

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.300
Nice to meet you.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.260
Master has been taking good care of me.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.960
I'm Saria.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:29.890
I'm Seiichi's wife!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.390
Oh, my...

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.700
Oh?

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:34.600
Way to go, Seiichi-kun!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:37.250
I'm surprised you landed such 
an adorable partner!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:39.400
Y-Yes, well...

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.040
I-I'm Artoria Gremm.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:45.780
I'm, um, Seiichi's... g-g-g-girlfriend!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.730
What?! This one's your girlfriend?!

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:49.790
Oh, well, that's...

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.390
I'm Lulune.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:55.290
I've dedicated my body and soul 
to Master as his loyal servant!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.870
S-Servant?!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.370
What kind of introductions are these?!

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:02.930
A wife, a girlfriend, and a servant...

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.340
You're wild, Seiichi-kun.

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:06.800
N-Nah...

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:07.680
Master.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:12.940
I am proud to have a master like you.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.300
Impressive, Seiichi-kun.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:19.450
Any other man would go up in flames 
and be forced to show restraint.

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:24.260
<i>What's happening to my reputation?</i>

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.670
Now then, little kitten...

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.210
Today we're going to make 
you spill everything.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.570
<i>It wasn't until after this that I learned</i>

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:53.920
<i>all about the far too tragic past 
that this tiny girl shouldered.</i>

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:29.110
Time for "Seiichi's Status for Today"!

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:31.270
Huh? We're doing it in the bath?!

00:22:31.270 --> 00:22:33.370
At least wrap a bath towel around yourself!

