Looks like it hasn't changed too much.

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:46.860
So now we need an emergency plan.

00:22:47.260 --> 00:22:49.390
First, please have a look here.

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:58.940
We'll have both Ar and Lulune-chan 
attempt this kiss scene!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:00.120
Huh?

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:02.190
What do you mean?

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:09.320
You'll each be presented in order, so please 
show us how you'd kiss Seiichi's cheek!

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:11.340
Let's start right now!

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:12.900
First up is Lulune-chan.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.980
Three, two, one! Go!

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:17.830
Smooch...

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:20.120
Next is Ar! Give it a try!

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.720
Three, two, one! Go!

00:23:24.200 --> 00:23:25.590
Smooch...

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:29.420
And there you have it! 
We'll see you again next time!

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:31.460
Goodbye!

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:34.050
Where did that forced cue even come from?!

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:39.180
Seiichi saves Oliga from 
her dark, tragic curse.

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:42.080
There's barely a moment to enjoy a new ally

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:44.050
before a dark threat takes action.

